s with retailers and tightly controlling inventory — but the stock bounced and then fell back, revealing that the sports-brand cycle is really a game of inventory versus expectations. 商业就是这样 商业就是这样 Vol.271 阿迪达斯如何触底反弹？ Adidas Sports Brands Inventory Management Stock Cycle Retro Sneakers Consumer Goods Samba Months of saleable inventory Write-down provision Breaking 2\" href=\"/podcast/en/p/2026-08-19-bizthisway-阿迪达斯触底反弹-炒冷饭比巨星联名更稳/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">28:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"cn\"><span class=\"src\" lang=\"zh\">商业就是这样</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>Adidas Bounces Off the Bottom: Reheating Old Shoes Beats a Superstar Collab</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">After nearly halving from its 2021 peak, Adidas staged a recovery by thawing out retro sneakers, repairing relations with retailers and tightly controlling inventory — but the stock bounced and then fell back, revealing that the sports-brand cycle is really a game of inventory versus expectations.</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> Points</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> Quotes</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Adidas</span><span class=\"tag\">Sports Brands</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI Is Devaluing Code. An Engineer&#x27;s Moat Is Taste and Accountability Addy Osmani, who leads Chrome DevTools, argues that AI has devalued writing code, and that an engineer&#x27;s real edge is taste and accountability. Beware cognitive surrender: taking the AI&#x27;s answer as your own. The Pragmatic Engineer The Pragmatic Engineer From Chrome DevTools to AI Engineering, with Addy Osmani Chrome DevTools AI engineering cognitive surrender taste moat career transition frontend cognitive surrender alpha unbundling\" href=\"/podcast/en/p/2026-0